  "the_number_that_is_not_reassuring": "8/174 junction peptides and 2/11 ranked binders contribute ZERO residues from EWSR1 — they are one hybrid seam residue away from being wild-type NR4A3 peptides, and the four that a real isoform happened to reproduce are drawn entirely from that class."
